{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7860e360-e3c6-87dd-9dd9-ad2d29e03b37",
  "created_at": "2026-01-15T11:12:31-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Kwame Cohen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:09:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:09:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, um, yeah. I'm calling about my mother's water and sewer bill. It's for 161 Annandale Road, up the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:09:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 161 Annandale. And you're her son?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:09:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, well, I'm her son, Kwame. I handle the bills for her. And honestly, this one is way higher than it should be. [line breaks up] ...doesn't make any sense."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:09:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up on me there. Said it doesn't make sense?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:09:33-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the bill. It jumped. She's one person in the house, so there's no reason it's that high, and I'm not paying it until somebody looks at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:09:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. What I can do is pull up the account and walk you through the readings. Do you want the usage broken out by month?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:09:52-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. By month. Um, I'm putting together a budget for her, so I need to see what she actually uses month to month, not just one lump number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:10:03-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Give me a second here. [pause] Okay, I've got the account up. The bill is based on the meter reading, so the usage shows as units between each reading. I can go back through the last several bills for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:10:18-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, well, here's the thing. We had a plumber out a few weeks ago. Fixed a running toilet, I think, and I kept the receipt. So if that was leaking, that'd explain it, but then it should come back down, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:10:33-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It should, once the leak is fixed. A running toilet can add up fast. The next reading after the repair is where you'd see it drop. Hang on to that receipt, and when you get the next bill, if it's still high, call us back and we can have the meter rechecked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:10:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Yeah. I just think it's ridiculous that nobody flags a jump like that. [line breaks up] ...a notice or something."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:11:00-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'll note the plumber visit on the account so it's on record. Now for the month by month, would you like me to read it out, or have it mailed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:11:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mailed is fine, um, but can you just tell me the last couple now? I'm writing it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:11:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. I'll read the last three readings and the units for each, and you can total it up. Ready when you are."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:11:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go ahead. Well, hold on, let me get a pen. Okay. Go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:11:32-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the earliest one shows a normal level, and the most recent one is about double that. That's your spike, and it lines up with a leak running through that period."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:11:44-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that tracks. Okay. One more thing. If I drop a payment in the box tonight, after you're closed, does that count as on time? Or is it only when you open in the morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:11:57-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The drop box is checked each business day, and a payment put in before the due date is generally treated as on time. You can also pay online anytime, day or night, through the city website."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:12:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. I'll do the box then, I'm over that way later. [pause] Oh, sorry, I've gotta run soon. I apprentice with a roofer and I've got a ladder lesson at one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:12:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Don't be late for that one. I'll get the monthly breakdown mailed out to your mother's address today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:12:29-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
